OL,3,AChancellor to cut tariffs on some food
OL,4,Aand freeze fuel duty to give families
OL,5,A'breathing space'
OL,6,
OL,7,FMaking higher tax-free mileage rates
OL,8,Fpermanent and the removal of import
OL,9,Ftaxes on some food items are among the
OL,10,Fmeasures being announced ahead of
OL,11,FWednesday's Budget.
OL,13,FThe BBC understands the government will
OL,14,Falso freeze fuel duty again in the
OL,15,FBudget, while the Times reports it may
OL,16,Falso slow the pace of pay increases for
OL,17,Fyounger workers on the minimum wage.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
