CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1793098553
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ALula's comeback in Brazil dents Trump's
OL,4,Aambitions for Latin America
OL,5,
OL,6,FParadoxically, it seems to have earned
OL,7,Fhim President Donald Trump's respect.
OL,8,F"I like Lula, we get along well," Trump
OL,9,Fsaid, responding to the result. "I
OL,10,Fdidn't take sides," he added, before
OL,11,Fcalling the election "terrible" and
OL,12,F"rigged".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
