OL,3,ATruce begins in Ukraine city where
OL,4,Aresidents ate weeds to survive
OL,5,
OL,6,FA truce has begun in the
OL,7,FRussian-occupied Ukrainian city of
OL,8,FOleshky, where residents have been
OL,9,Ftrapped without food, water and
OL,10,Felectricity.
OL,12,FUkrainian officials and Russia's
OL,13,Fdefence ministry say the limited
OL,14,Fceasefire is being respected. The
OL,15,Ftruce, which the White House said was
OL,16,Fsecured by US First Lady Melania Trump,
OL,17,Fis meant to allow aid deliveries and
OL,18,Fcivilian evacuation on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
